  "description": "Monkey in the Zoo puts you inside the mind — and mischief — of a monkey behind bars. The real attraction isn’t you… it’s the unpredictable humans who wander up to your cage.\n\nSome visitors arrive with smiles and snacks.\nOthers come armed with loud voices, pushy attitudes, or questionable intentions.\nHow you react — playful, curious, or gloriously chaotic — shapes every moment.\n\nGrab whatever you can reach.\nEat it, throw it, break it, or offer it back with suspicious kindness.\nYour cage is a fully interactive playground, and every visitor becomes part of your improvised story.\n\nFrom harmless comedy to tense standoffs, no encounter is ever the same.\n\nYou may be behind bars — but you decide who’s really in control.",
